<title>USA: Lasersight IBM patent deal to close soon.</title>
<headline>Lasersight IBM patent deal to close soon.</headline>
<dateline>ST. LOUIS 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>LaserSight Inc said Thursday it was working with potential funding sources related to its patent purchase agreement with International Business Machines Corp and expected the deal to close in August.</p>
<p>LaserSight said it was working with several potential sources of funding, including other industry participants, on the purchase.</p>
<p>LaserSight said in February it agreed to purchase fundamental claim stem patents related to ultraviolet light ophthalmic products and procedures for laser vision correction from IBM.</p>
</text>
